#!info##DEV WORM template written in Python, designed without a specific purpose. It allows integration of any number of additional Python-based modules. Ideal for building custom payloads and flexible worm structures in Python.
#!lang##python
#!Wprocess##BasicPy
#!wormCompiler##PyInstaller
